Description: Tvheadend desktop client with a built-in server
 A desktop client for Tvheadend for live TV playback and recording.
 .
 Features:
  * Live TV playback
  * EPG (Electronic Program Guide)
  * Recording on the server or locally
  * Multiple Tvheadend server support
  * A built-in Tvheadend that starts and stops with the app, kept
    separate from any Tvheadend installed on the system
